      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential: Approved synchronization connector credential; no export in this record.\nDelegation: Tenant owner authorizes exact sync capability.\nRevoke — Tenant identity owner: Disable connector authorization, isolate affected objects and reconcile cloud sign-ins.\nTiming/residual: 30-minute proposed objective; propagation untested. Cloud hashes, sessions and already granted access can persist.",
      "originalText": "Credential: Approved synchronization connector credential; no export in this record.\nDelegation: Tenant owner authorizes exact sync capability.\nRevoke — Tenant identity owner: Disable connector authorization, isolate affected objects and reconcile cloud sign-ins.\nTiming/residual: 30-minute proposed objective; propagation untested. Cloud hashes, sessions and already granted access can persist.",
