      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential: Service-issued audience-bound tokens accepted by the application's configured trust.\nDelegation: Application owner configures exact issuer/audience and group/app-role mapping.\nRevoke — Application and identity owners: Remove app assignment/trust and block at app policy; reconcile valid token/session lifetimes.\nTiming/residual: 30-minute proposed effective-denial target; not measured. Token expiry and app session revocation may differ.",
      "originalText": "Credential: Service-issued audience-bound tokens accepted by the application's configured trust.\nDelegation: Application owner configures exact issuer/audience and group/app-role mapping.\nRevoke — Application and identity owners: Remove app assignment/trust and block at app policy; reconcile valid token/session lifetimes.\nTiming/residual: 30-minute proposed effective-denial target; not measured. Token expiry and app session revocation may differ.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 2.5,
