      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential: Environment-bound managed identity or narrow issuer/subject/audience workload federation.\nDelegation: Application owner approves deployment subject and environment.\nRevoke — Application release owner: Disable deployment binding, remove resource permission and block pending deployment.\nTiming/residual: 15-minute proposed objective. Previously deployed code must also be assessed/rolled back.",
      "originalText": "Credential: Environment-bound managed identity or narrow issuer/subject/audience workload federation.\nDelegation: Application owner approves deployment subject and environment.\nRevoke — Application release owner: Disable deployment binding, remove resource permission and block pending deployment.\nTiming/residual: 15-minute proposed objective. Previously deployed code must also be assessed/rolled back.",
